<title>JAPAN: Tachikawa -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tachikawa -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.73		vs	    2.02</p>
<p> Operating   loss 194    million	  vs   loss 103    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 182    million	  vs    loss 88    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 190    million	  vs    loss 90    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 13.60 yen	  vs     loss 6.48 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tachikawa Co Ltd is a textile wholesaler.</p>
</text>
